{"4423120": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Alley Dodge", "steam_appid": 4423120, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BEWARE! Giant red cube-shaped obstacles are steadily approaching. You must lean, duck, or climb to avoid colliding with them… or be exploded into smithereens!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So get ready to get good (or even more good) at getting out of the way in <i>Alley Dodge</i>. It might even be fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Easy to learn VR action inspired by classic arcade video games of the 1980's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Highly customizable game options able to entertain total beginners to expert-level players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• Cheers of the in-game announcer's excitable words paired with colorful bursts of confetti.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• And maybe even getting a bit of exercise that doesn't feel like work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Please note before downloading:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A VR headset and hand controllers are REQUIRED to play this game properly. It has been tested to work with the following brands/models:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HTC Vive 1 and 2</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meta Quest 2 and 3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Valve Index</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄▀▄</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>BEWARE! Giant red cube-shaped obstacles are steadily approaching. You must lean, duck, or climb to avoid colliding with them… or be exploded into smithereens!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So get ready to get good (or even more good) at getting out of the way in <i>Alley Dodge</i>. It might even be fun!</p><p cl